From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MC20018 <winme2001@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 09:34:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add modern gameplay event hooks

Forward replaceable player input and client-loaded acknowledgements to the Fand event bridge.

Expose cancellable shelf swaps, crafter crafts, copper golem inventory transfers, item-use lifecycles, and kinetic weapon hits with their native runtime context.

Publish modern entity and block-entity state needed by the server-side API wrappers.

